nerys that  only death can pay for life and I think  as soon as Viserion died his sacrifice  will allow Daenerys to have a child his  death will pay for the life of her baby  Jorah Mormont also foreshadowed John  having children and even John told  Daenerys that maybe marry masters  prophecy wasn't true there was so much  force shadowing over the course of  season 7 I would actually be surprised  if this did not happen in my opinion I  feel like this one is a guarantee but we  shall see number 6  King's Landing is destroyed this theory  continues to gain steam and it's also  been foreshadowed a few times we saw  glimpses of this happening all the way  back in season 2 when Daenerys enter  visions at the house of the undying  brain stark also touched a weirwood tree  beyond the wall and he saw visions of  King's Landing destroyed given the  current state of Westeros I think this  is very likely to happen Cersei  Lannister has no plans of leaving King's  Landing and now that she has lied to Jon  and Danny's faces this may leave  Daenerys no choice but to remove Cersei  from the city by force we also know  Cersei has no problem with using  wildfire to burn down her own city so  she might even do this herself  my king is also south of the wall and  he's now riding a dragon of his own we  don't know where he plans on going but  if he gets anywhere near King's Landing  then the capital was in deep deep  doo-doo not to mention some spoiler  photos have came out and in those photos  you can see that King's Landing set has  been burned to a certain extent it looks  like only the top of the walls have been  burned which most likely means the fire  came from above by a dragon when you put  everything into consideration I don't  see it ending any other way by the time  the narrow steps foot in the throne room  it will probably look exactly like it  did when she had her visions but only  time will tell  number seven a dance with dragons 2.0 I  think this one is almost a guarante